{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"norway-electricity-support-comparator UI copy.details","detected_language":"en","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"norway-electricity-support-comparator.copy.details","keys":["norway-electricity-support-comparator.copy.details"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"The standard household support pays ZXQPH0000QXZ of each hourly spot-price amount above NOK ZXQPH0001QXZ/kWh before VAT, for eligible use up to ZXQPH0002QXZ kWh per month. Norgespris uses a fixed reference price of NOK ZXQPH0003QXZ/kWh including VAT (NOK ZXQPH0004QXZ without electricity VAT); its settlement uses the full month's area-average spot price and eligible metered use. The cap is ZXQPH0005QXZ kWh/month for a home or ZXQPH0006QXZ kWh/month for a holiday home. A household can choose one scheme, not both. Network charges and other fees are entered separately and added to all scenarios. The comparison uses the exact hourly data you provide; it does not fetch prices.","record_id":"6941dde9e747ad2a9c9354da1d70436d90e36e5f1ead0e15d3f6078eb41be50c","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.7155009006249884,"source":"The standard household support pays 90% of each hourly spot-price amount above NOK 0.77/kWh before VAT, for eligible use up to 5,000 kWh per month. Norgespris uses a fixed reference price of NOK 0.50/kWh including VAT (NOK 0.40 without electricity VAT); its settlement uses the full month’s area-average spot price and eligible metered use. The cap is 5,000 kWh/month for a home or 1,000 kWh/month for a holiday home. A household can choose one scheme, not both. Network charges and other fees are entered separately and added to all scenarios. The comparison uses the exact hourly data you provide; it does not fetch prices.","source_